em and $u(t)$ is a column vector of functions to be determined. A derivation of the formula for ${x}_{p}(t)$ is given below. \n\n$\\text{L1}:\\,$ ${x}_{p}(t)=Φu(t)$\n\n$\\text{L2}:\\,$ ${x}_{p}^{′}(t)=Φ{u}^{′}(t)+{Φ}^{′}u(t)$\n\n$\\text{L3}:\\,$ $Φ{u}^{′}(t)+{Φ}^{′}u(t)=AΦu(t)+f(t)$\n\n$\\text{L4}:\\,$ ${Φ}^{′}=AΦ$\n\n$\\text{L5}:\\,$ $Φ{u}^{′}(t)=f(t)$\n\n$\\text{L6}:\\,$ ${u}^{′}(t)={Φ}^{-1}(t)f(t)$\n\n$\\text{L7}:\\,$ $u(t)=\\int {Φ}^{-1}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t$\n\n$\\text{L8}:\\,$ ${x}_{p}(t)=Φ\\int {Φ}^{-1}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t$\n\nSelect the correct options in the following reasoning.\n\n$\\,$ Line $\\text{L2}$ follows from line $\\text{L1}$ by {{field-1}} both sides of  the equation.\n\n$\\,$ Line $\\text{L7}$ follows from line $\\text{L6}$ by {{field-2}} both sides of the equation.\n\n$\\,$ Line $\\text{L8}$ is obtained by substituting {{field-3}} into {{field-4}}." #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186396972 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "68ae00aa-e57d-5620-9c00-ead6febaac73" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186396972 #edb/ref 1074 "Let's examine each statement in turn.\n\n- We first consider lines $\\text{L1}$ and $\\text{L2}.$ To get $\\text{L2},$ we are $\\text{differentiating}$ with respect to $t$ both sides of the equation in $\\text{L1}:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{p}^{′}(t) & =(Φu(t))^{′} \\\\ {x}_{p}^{′}(t) & =Φ{u}^{′}(t)+{Φ}^{′}u(t)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- Next, we consider lines $\\text{L6}$ and $\\text{L7}.$ To get $\\text{L7},$ we are $\\text{integrating}$ both sides of the equation in $\\text{L6}:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int {u}^{′}(t)\\,\\text{d}t & =\\int {Φ}^{-1}(t)f(t)\\,\\text{d}t \\\\ u(t) & =\\int {Φ}^{-1}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- Finally, we consider lines $\\text{L1},$ $\\text{L7},$ and $\\text{L8}.$ Substituting\n\n$$\nu(t)=\\int {Φ}^{-1}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t\n$$\n\nfrom $\\text{L7}$ into $\\text{L1},$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{p}(t) & =Φu(t) \\\\  & =Φ\\int {Φ}^{-1}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $\\text{L8}$ is obtained by substituting $\\text{L7}$ into $\\text{L1}.$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186396973 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186396974 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186396973 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186396975 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186396973 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186396976 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186396973 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186396977 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186396973 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045494 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186396973 #edb/ref 1077 "field-2" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186396973 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186396975 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186396973 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "78540bb9-06e5-582a-8e49-d50e3c4417c5" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186396974 #edb/ref 1080 "adding $Φ$ to" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186396974 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186396974 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "cad9d195-9c91-5200-8667-b1a991261f11" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186396975 #edb/ref 1080 "integrating" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186396975 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186396975 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "68556745-4530-55da-ac24-38d37038b33a" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186396976 #edb/ref 1080 "differentiating" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186396976 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186396976 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "04a2a1fa-05d3-5caf-802d-b281aaf8f532" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186396977 #edb/ref 1080 "pre-multiplying by ${Φ}^{-1}$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186396977 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186396977 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "cfdd0c3c-942e-5b0b-87e1-55d9e7172922" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186396978 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186396979 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186396978 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186396980 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186396978 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186396981 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186396978 #edb/ref 1075 